8. Emscripten

Applies to: the web release asset (synesthesia-vibe-web-<version>.zip) and any
build of platform/web/. The generated synesthesia-vibe-wasm.js and
synesthesia-vibe-wasm.wasm embed Emscripten's runtime support code (the JS
glue, the Emscripten system libraries and the musl-derived libc the toolchain
links in). No Emscripten source is kept in this repository; the build obtains
emsdk 6.0.12 at build time.

  Emscripten: https://emscripten.org
  Source:     https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten

